$$
\lim_{n\to\infty}D_q(\rho^{2n}s,\rho^{2n}t)=0,
\tag{NMF.12.1}
$$

because $0<2q<1$. This is a limit of metric values for finite trees. It
does not assert an infinite native tree $\lim_n\rho^{2n}s$, an infinite
